    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d544">

                <pb facs="0667" n="559" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg559"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Snowden.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-05"><hi rendition="#italic">January 5,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Snowden is advised that the Caroline claim should not be connected with any
                    other question, and that the President desires a satisfactory settlement without
                    delay. He is directed to report progress by telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
